{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18147","headline":"早春雪中闻莺 · 韩愈","name":"早春雪中闻莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝莺雪里新，雪树眼前春。\n带涩先迎气，侵寒已报人。\n共矜初听早，谁贵後闻频。\n暂啭那成曲，孤鸣岂及辰。\n风霜徒自保，桃李讵相亲。\n寄谢幽栖友，辛勤不爲身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}